Modifications: standalone sensor lifecycle for unitree_mujoco, ROS domain 10,
Fast DDS, MuJoCo 3.3.6 linkage, double-buffered rendering snapshots, simulation
clock, optical-frame TF, reset/unload handling, and invalid-depth conversion.
Lidar modifications: SensorManager integration without ros2_control/pluginlib,
MuJoCo 3.3.6 ray API, owned double-buffered snapshots with refreshed geometry,
simulation-time rate control, reset generation handling, sensor QoS, site TF,
configuration validation, and non-duplicated full-circle azimuth sampling.
